|YK0++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++|GKB
			MONK STICK
|YK0++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++

|YKB'The simplest weapon is often the greatest when placed in the hands
of a master' - |RKBMaster Maelstrom
|YK0
The monk stick is not just a weapon. It is a monks best friend.
It travels with the monk on their daily journeys, and is a tool
for recording these travels.

As a monk notches the stick to mark the various areas and lands
visited it becomes crafted and shaped becoming a highly versatile
and potentially lethal weapon.

By typing |GKBnotch |YK0the additional stick commands are displayed.

When a monk enters a new area he may add a new notch to his stick
through the use of the |GKBnotch add |YK0command. 

|YK0The |GKBnotch list |YK0command will display a list of all areas that a
monk has visited.

A monk may use the command |GKBsling |YK0to place the stick across their
back. It may be recalled using the command |GKBgrasp|YK0. 

A stick may NEVER be passed to another and a monk would rather
die that lose this treasured object. It is the only true possession
of each individual monk.

++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
